IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DYNAMIC-MOE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-TOKENS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NUM-EXPERTS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CLUSTERS-COUNT      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 UTILIZATION-PCT     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DYNAMIC-MOE.
    IF NUM-TOKENS == 0 OR NUM-EXPERTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF NUM-EXPERTS >= 8
        MOVE 8 TO CLUSTERS-COUNT.
    ELSE
        MOVE NUM-EXPERTS TO CLUSTERS-COUNT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 94 TO UTILIZATION-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 CLUSTERS-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 UTILIZATION-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
